{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Prologue of &quot;<i>Car Wash Simulator</i>&quot;, you will experience washing gameplay with hand-picked exclusive cars just for this version.  You have the water pressure gun and a trusty soapy sponge along with it you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version concentrates on the core gameplay mechanics for you to try it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wash, foam and relax. Feel the satisfying experience. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> START WASHING! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/car-wash-simulator-washing-mechanic-main.gif?t=1740449294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/express-car-wash-simulator-wash-header.gif?t=1740449294\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy and intuitive mechanics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Jump to the action straight away- </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/car-wash-simulator-cardbox.gif?t=1740449294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/express-car-wash-simulator-upgrade.gif?t=1740449294\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build and manage your own car wash:</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156530/extras/Timelapse_1_Border-ezgif.com-opti